    <bpmn:process id="W_W5450" name="W5450. Demolition Debris Load-Out, Dust/Noise &amp; Neighbor Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Demolition-phase job (interior demo, full structure, post-disaster VS-184)
Frequency: Per demolition job; ~hundreds/yr
Volume: Larger/heavier debris loads; longer on-site duration
Owner: Demolition/ Site Cleanup Supervisor
Participants: Crew, HSE (VS-24), customer, neighbors/HOA, LGU (VS-76), PCAB (VS-165)
Source: workflow W5450 — Demolition Debris Load-Out, Dust/Noise &amp; Neighbor Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5450_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5450_Lane1" name="Site Cleanup Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5450_Lane2" name="Crew Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5450_Lane3" name="Site Cleanup Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5450_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5450_Start5" name="Demolition-phase job (interior demo, full structure, post-disaster VS-184)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5450_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5450_Task6" name="Confirm demolition scope vs. PCAB/permit coverage (VS-165) and the LGU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm demolition scope vs. PCAB/permit coverage (VS-165) and the LGU demolition/building permit; do not exceed the permitted scope.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Supervisor / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5450_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5450_Task7" name="Deploy dust/noise/vibration controls (water suppression, tarps, scheduling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Deploy dust/noise/vibration controls (water suppression, tarps, scheduling noisy work within allowed hours, debris chute).
Responsible (R): Crew Lead
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Supervisor
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5450_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5450_Task8" name="Notify neighbors/HOA per LGU/condominium requirements and manage complaints…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Notify neighbors/HOA per LGU/condominium requirements and manage complaints through the escalation path.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5450_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5450_Task9" name="Sequence demolition to preserve structural elements per plan (load-bearing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Sequence demolition to preserve structural elements per plan (load-bearing, shared walls) and protect utilities.
Responsible (R): Crew Lead / Customer PM
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Supervisor
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5450_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5450_Task10" name="Load demolition debris (heavier rubble, mixed) — possibly requiring heavy haul…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Load demolition debris (heavier rubble, mixed) — possibly requiring heavy haul (VS-186 equipment, VS-74 heavy delivery) — and route per W5453.
Responsible (R): Crew Lead
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Supervisor
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5450_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5450_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5450_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-804 (ensure controlled execution — Debris Collection, Segregation &amp; DENR-Compliant Hauling Execution (PA-191.2).) | - operational: noisy work only within LGU-permitted hours.
Owner: Demolition/ Site Cleanup Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5450_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5450_Annotation12" targetRef="W5450_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
