    <bpmn:process id="W_W5451" name="W5451. C&amp;D Debris Weight/Volume Verification &amp; Weighbridge Ticket Capture" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Load departs site; arrival at disposer/transfer; billing
Frequency: Per haul/load
Volume: ~thousands of loads/yr
Owner: Site Cleanup Coordinator
Participants: Hauler (VS-56/VS-110), Disposer (W5447), Finance (VS-15), Calibration (VS-115)
Source: workflow W5451 — C&amp;D Debris Weight/Volume Verification &amp; Weighbridge Ticket Capture</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5451_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5451_Lane1" name="Crew Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5451_Lane2" name="Hauler">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5451_Lane3" name="Site Cleanup Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5451_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5451_Start5" name="Load departs site; arrival at disposer/transfer; billing">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5451_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5451_Task6" name="Capture the load&#x27;s volume estimate at load-out (W5449) and verify against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Capture the load&#x27;s volume estimate at load-out (W5449) and verify against container/truck capacity.
Responsible (R): Crew Lead
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Supervisor
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5451_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5451_Task7" name="At the weighbridge/disposer, capture the certified weight ticket (VS-115 W3626…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: At the weighbridge/disposer, capture the certified weight ticket (VS-115 W3626 scale calibration ensures accuracy); reconcile to volume estimate.
Responsible (R): Hauler / Disposer
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5451_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5451_Task8" name="Record weight/volume, stream composition, and disposal/processing destination…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Record weight/volume, stream composition, and disposal/processing destination against the manifest (W5452).
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5451_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5451_Task9" name="Flag discrepancies (significant overweight/underweight vs. estimate, unexpected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Flag discrepancies (significant overweight/underweight vs. estimate, unexpected stream) for investigation.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5451_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5451_Task10" name="Feed verified weights into billing/settlement (W5457) and the diversion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Feed verified weights into billing/settlement (W5457) and the diversion analytics (W5459).
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Finance
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5451_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5451_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5451_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-804 (ensure controlled execution — Debris Collection, Segregation &amp; DENR-Compliant Hauling Execution (PA-191.2).) | - operational: weight/volume accuracy with manifest/weight-ticket evidence; certified-scale requirement (VS-115).
