      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5452_Start5" name="Load departs site; manifest system">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5452_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5452_Task6" name="Confirm the transporter is DENR-registered / LGU-permitted for C&amp;D hauling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm the transporter is DENR-registered / LGU-permitted for C&amp;D hauling (W5447 onboarding; VS-166 permit portfolio).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per hauler</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5452_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5452_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5452_Task7" name="Generate a hauling manifest per load: origin, stream composition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Generate a hauling manifest per load: origin, stream composition, volume/weight, transporter, destination (recycler/MDRF/landfill), and generator (BuildRight on behalf of customer).
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5452_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5452_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5452_Task8" name="Capture chain-of-custody signatures/stamps (origin → transporter → disposer) —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Capture chain-of-custody signatures/stamps (origin → transporter → disposer) — digital where the disposer supports it.
Responsible (R): Hauler / Disposer
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5452_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5452_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5452_Task9" name="Retain manifests per DENR (RA 6969/RA 9003) and BIR (W590 fuel/expense)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Retain manifests per DENR (RA 6969/RA 9003) and BIR (W590 fuel/expense) record-retention (VS-88; 10-yr per BIR).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5452_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5452_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
