        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Aggregate manifests for DENR/LGU periodic reporting and ESG disclosure (VS-25).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5452_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
