      <bpmn:userTask id="W5454_Task8" name="Crew stops work on the suspect material and isolates it; contacts the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Crew stops work on the suspect material and isolates it; contacts the supervisor/HSE for identification (asbestos/lead suspect, paint/solvent, chemical container, refrigerant, treated/e-waste).
Responsible (R): Crew Lead
Accountable (A): Site Cleanup Supervisor
Duration: on discovery</bpmn:documentation>
