        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HSE/Compliance identify the material and route to the correct handling path: asbestos/lead abatement (VS-73 W2613); household hazardous TSD (VS-187); refrigerant recovery (VS-143); e-waste (VS-187/VS-99).
Responsible (R): HSE / Compliance
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: per discovery</bpmn:documentation>
